==English==

===Etymology===
{{compound|curve|ball}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|baseball|lang=en}} A forespin [[pitch]] thrown by rotating the index and middle fingers down and resulting in motion down "curve"
#: ''He bit on a '''curveball''' in the dirt.''
# An unexpected turn of events initiated by an opponent or chance.
#: ''Life has thrown him a few '''curveballs'''.''

